.Dd November 24, 2026
.Dt AETERNUM-SET-WALLPAPER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm aeternum-set-wallpaper
.Nd set the Aeternum desktop wallpaper
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility waits three seconds for the XFCE desktop to start, then sets the
Aeternum wallpaper on every desktop and monitor entry reported by
.Xr xfconf-query 1
for the
.Li xfce4-desktop
channel.
It is started by the autostart entry
.Pa aeternum-wallpaper.desktop .
.Pp
If the wallpaper file does not exist,
.Nm
exits silently with status 0.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/share/backgrounds/aeternum/aeternum-wallpaper.png
The wallpaper.
.It Pa /usr/local/share/aeternum/skel/.config/autostart/aeternum-wallpaper.desktop
Autostart entry.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr xfconf-query 1 ,
.Xr aeternum 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Zef Lleshaj
